  message: "F5 C# field slice merged dev 4831ba1d45 — gate ratchet's THIRD cross-language field strip (after Java, Go). csharp.py now emits kind='field' per field_declaration declarator (was: only class_field_types populated; properties were already kind='property'), mirroring the method path: class-scoped qualified_name, canonical make_typed_stable_id, type as signature, public->is_exported, multi-declarator one-per-name. Field attributes ([Inject] DI, EF [Column]/[Key] ORM) flow through _extract_attribute_edges as decorated_by (C# stores them under meta['annotations'], not meta['decorators']). class_field_types chained resolution preserved. Strips (csharp, emits_field) -> hard lock (82 passed / 13 xfailed).\n\nGATE HOLES REMAINING: emits_field = python (class attributes), rust, swift; emits_variable = rust, swift. Done: JS/TS (both), Java/Go/C# (field). NEXT: Rust (double strip — struct fields + const/static variables -> both rust holes in one PR)."  # e20a
